Steps:
1. Send a GET request to /api/orders/last-measurement?customerPhone=<customer_phone>&itemId=<item_id> with the payload in testData.

Test Data: {
  "customerPhone": "5551234567",
  "itemId": 1
}

Expected Result:
HTTP 200 OK response with a JSON body containing: {
  "itemName": "Formal Shirt",
  "measurements": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "nameEn": "Waist",
      "nameBn": "কোমর",
      "unit": "inches",
      "value": 32.0,
      "booleanValue": null,
      "type": "NUMERIC"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "nameEn": "Has Pocket",
      "nameBn": "পকেট আছে",
      "unit": "",
      "value": null,
      "booleanValue": true,
      "type": "BOOLEAN"
    }
  ]
}

