1. Send a GET request to /api/orders/last-measurement?phone=<valid_phone>&itemId=<valid_item_id> with the payload in testData. 2. Observe the response body for measurement data.

Test Data: {
  "phone": "+8801712345678",
  "itemId": 1
}

1. (Backend injection simulation) Assume a malicious user attempts to inject a null or invalid 'type' value for a measurement. 2. Send a GET request to /api/orders/last-measurement?phone=<valid_phone>&itemId=<valid_item_id> expecting the system to handle the malformed data gracefully.

Test Data: {
  "phone": "+8801712345678",
  "itemId": 1
}

